                                "sense_id": "3722f5a3-8f43-37a0-82ec-847c999ed8eb",
                                "text": "Day by day, those who watched unremittingly by the bed-side, by the sofa, by the pillowed chair, saw hope recede farther and farther from them."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a7a8a55-90e5-4c47-b351-b553a152ef0a",
                                "sense_id": "3722f5a3-8f43-37a0-82ec-847c999ed8eb",
                                "text": "The grazes on his back redressed, he allowed Sean and the nurse to ease him back against the pillowed bed rest."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39032d85-a7ed-40ec-bcd0-95b13e1afdfb",
                                "sense_id": "3722f5a3-8f43-37a0-82ec-847c999ed8eb",
                                "text": "Coffee table, end table, pillowed couch were covered in printed matter."
                            }
